@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    Last updated: Whenever we last remembered to update it.

    Welcome to our Jokes App!
    Before you laugh, cringe, or question your life choices, here’s our totally serious, definitely-important Privacy Policy.

    Spoiler: We respect your privacy more than we respect punchlines.
    <br /> <br />
    1. What Information We Collect
    <br />
    Relax… we collect the bare minimum.

    ✔️ Basic App Usage Data

    We may collect anonymous information like:
    <br />
    How often you open the app
    <br />
    Whether you survive the punchlines
    <br />
    No, we don’t track your facial expressions.
    We can’t tell if you laughed, smiled, or stared blankly in disappointment.
    <br />
    ❌ What we absolutely do NOT collect
    <br /><br />
    Your name
    <br />
    Your contacts
    <br />
    Your crush’s number
    <br />
    Your embarrassing search history
    <br />
    Your sense of humor rating (we tried, but science said no)
    <br /><br />
    2. Why We Collect This Data
    <br />
    We use this tiny amount of anonymous data to:
    <br />
    Improve joke quality
    <br />
    Remove jokes that cause emotional damage
    <br />
    Add more jokes that make you question “why was this even funny?”
    <br />
    Humor is subjective.<br />
    Some jokes will make you laugh.<br />
    Some jokes will make you close the app.<br />
    This data helps us balance the two.
    <br /><br />
    3. Do We Share Your Data?
    <br />
    Short answer: No.
    <br />
    Long answer: Still no, unless the law forces us, or someone threatens us with dad jokes.
    <br />
    We don’t sell your data.<br />
    We don’t rent your data.<br />
    We don’t auction your data to the highest bidder.<br />
    <br />
    Your privacy is safe — even from bad punchlines.
    <br /><br />
    4. Cookies?
    <br />
    Nope.<br />
    We don’t use cookies.<br />
    But we encourage eating them while reading jokes.<br />
    <br /><br />
    5. Third-Party Services
    <br />
    If the app uses any third-party tools (like analytics), they follow their own privacy policies because apparently they’re adults and can make their own decisions.
    <br />
    Those services may collect anonymous data too — but nothing personally identifying.
    <br /><br />
    6. Children’s Privacy
    <br />
    Kids are welcome!<br />
    Our jokes may be silly, but they’re safe.<br />
    <br />
    We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.<br />
    If a parent thinks we accidentally collected something — tell us, and we’ll delete it faster than a bad joke bomb.<br />
    <br /><br />
    7. Changes to This Policy
    <br />
    If we update this privacy policy, we’ll let you know inside the app — no jump scares, no plot twists.
    <br /><br />
    8. Contact Us
    <br />
    Have questions?<br />
    Want to roast our jokes?<br />
    Accidentally read this entire page?<br />
    <br /><br />
    You can reach us at:<br />
    📧 info@jokesapp.com
    <br />
    We promise to read your message… eventually.
</p>
